# CVE-2026-33671: picomatch ReDoS via extglob patterns
# Affects picomatch <4.0.4 / <3.0.2 / <2.3.2
# picomatch is a transitive dependency of npm (the CLI bundled inside the
# node:22 base image), NOT a dependency of this application. It is not
# reachable from our code paths. Fix is owned by the Node.js image
# maintainer and will be resolved when the base image is updated.
CVE-2026-33671
